# Normalise to LF, which is what all three source repositories already store.
#
# Measured at the merge: of the Portal's 43 files, 42 were stored LF and one
# (README.md) CRLF; the visualiser and the solver were LF throughout. So this
# rewrites exactly one file, once.
#
# Without it, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true stages CRLF for
# everything and produces a whitespace-only diff across every file in the
# repository, authored by whoever ran the merge. That would bury the per-author
# contribution record the subtree import exists to preserve (ADR-0007).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.zip binary
